nts","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","review_id":"hbiZ4ZMWIcyKs0uGf-pMng","date":"2009-04-12T03:49:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9448515176773071,"text_excerpt":"This place was excellent - reading all the reviews of breakfast, I'm definitely jealous that I won't be in NoLa long enough to try it. My friends and I went here for dinner on Friday night. While Bourbon Street was insane, this place is just slightly removed (on the Irish strip, lolllll). My friend who helped with Katrina recovery had been here four years ago, and the Coffee Pot was the only thing that was open then... and she said it was an amazing experience. So of course we had to go again. The food here is excellent. I had the Bourbon baked chicken, which is seafood stuffed chicken with creole sauce (which isn't as spicy as I thought it would be), which came with some amazing potatoes..."},{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","review_id":"V0TCd9pCEMFm99-9e7dIVQ","date":"2015-06-22T23:43:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9379075765609741,"text_excerpt":"This place is wonderful. I went there for dinner one day and then breakfast the next. For dinner I had the Crawfish bisque but I had to send it back because it was very salty. So, I got the fried shrimp and catfish in its place and I was very pleased. I dined outside but there was an issue of things floating in my beverages (possibly from the roof). But the waiter replaced my drinks with no problem. The next day I ordered an omelette with spinach, tomatoes, cheese, potatoes and grits on the side. It was DELICIOUS! I can't wait to go back. And the waitresses were absolutely WONDERFUL and charming."},{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","review_id":"_FCN9bg5p1-pyRiZgX9ilQ","date":"2013-12-03T18:34:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9361095428466797,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! It's very close to Jackson Square, but tucked away so that it's not too much of a tourist trap. My friends and I went here on my sister's recommendation and it did not disappoint! The brunch menu was fantastic - very New Orleans. I ordered the Rockefeller Omelette with grits and it was delicious! The grits were the best I had in the French Quarter and the biscuit that came with my meal was warm and flaky. My friends loved their meals as well and we were sad that we didn't find this place until our last day. Even though we were full, we indulged in an order of strawberry blintzes to share and they were equally as good. The best part was the service - we were warmly greeted..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","photo_id":"_4dKM4odCQQfFRG64tod8A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_4dKM4odCQQfFRG64tod8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.858862042427063},{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","photo_id":"LsTLVvDbAGQM5Z-t9edzsQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LsTLVvDbAGQM5Z-t9edzsQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8413856029510498},{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","photo_id":"XMDPZBBpTu87ZEfy95b1zw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/XMDPZBBpTu87ZEfy95b1zw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7615947723388672},{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","photo_id":"g5hvWaN9TMCePru_pdHmvQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/g5hvWaN9TMCePru_pdHmvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7613570094108582},{"business_id":"8BhNur6_XKLjCDvbhX2CNg","photo_id":"M7Nb5s3du0U5fb4Nvrtm0A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/M7Nb5s3du0U5fb4Nvrtm0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.74928879737854}]},"notebook_case":null}
